    },
    {
      "id": "5f4ba8e2",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "To load the library, use the `using` statement. Then define the two vectors `x` and `y`, listing their elements separated by spaces within square brackets. Next, plot a scatter graph using the `scatter(x,y)` function.\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
