      "source": [
        "* [`DataFrames.jl`](https://engee.com/helpcenter/stable/julia/DataFrames/index.html) is a package providing tools for working with tabular data.\n* [`LaTeXStrings.jl`](https://engee.com/helpcenter/stable/julia/LaTeXStrings/README.html) is a package that simplifies the input of **LaTeX** equations in string-type variables and constants.\n\n"
      ],
