    {
      "id": "6d90fd0d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Signal processing and communications\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d16d8195",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "* [`FFTW.jl`](https://engee.com/helpcenter/stable/julia/FFTW.html) is a package containing functions for fast Fourier transforms.\n* [`Noise.jl`](https://engee.com/helpcenter/stable/julia/Noise/index.html) is a package containing functions for adding various types of noise to signals and images.\n* [`DSP.jl`](https://engee.com/helpcenter/stable/julia/DSP.html) is a package containing a range of functions for digital signal processing (periodogram calculation, windowing functions, filter synthesis and filtering, convolution, correlation, and linear predictive coding).\n* [`DigitalComm.jl`](https://engee.com/helpcenter/stable/julia/DigitalComm/index.html) – this package provides some useful tools for managing digital communication blocks (bit manipulation, modulation and demodulation, generation and decoding of multi-carrier signals).\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5d28ea39",
